{"id":1415,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p><br></p><p>为确保2026届毕业生能及时、准确地收到个人重要材料，7月3日下午14:30，学院组织全体毕业班班主任、辅导员，在09102为毕业生集中分装人事档案、毕业证、学位证、毕业照片及各类奖励荣誉证书，并逐一核对邮寄信息，将这份承载着母校关怀的“毕业大礼包”通过快递精准寄送至每一位学子手中。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLNl6aUlLYnzlDn_mWkUN7Yo7CYn77F8UzVRLlMkozMfMN70gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hVM1y8M4laMm7Ynm6fMlnRMm-PUNMRnm9YozV2L4AFn7VkMRV2UNWFUNVVM1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5D6E64750612F7A5DC621BCCF8291F38/DAB41FBB/BAE6\" vheight=\"219.8699951171875\" vwidth=\"293.07000732421875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLNl6aUlLYnzlDn_mWkUN7Yo7CYn77F8UzVRLlMkozMfMN70gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hVM1y8M4laMm7Ynm6fMlnRMm-PUNMRnm9YozV2L4AFn7VkMRV2UNWFUNVVM1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vU4v6PMzGsLz9Dn_NL8o77sLRffL7WFkM87bMmN4oz7YUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVokysU1h7olW2oRW7L7UYLzT2n7l8Ll7sMRUZoRC4ozTFL49ZM4GaL4QFUN7ankb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2E87BD9BF82D0D219FDE41A744886399/38870036/BA0D\" vheight=\"219.1999969482422\" vwidth=\"292.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vU4v6PMzGsLz9Dn_NL8o77sLRffL7WFkM87bMmN4oz7YUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVokysU1h7olW2oRW7L7UYLzT2n7l8Ll7sMRUZoRC4ozTFL49ZM4GaL4QFUN7ankb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>分发现场，老师们和志愿者们化身细心的“打包员”与“核对员”。从前期的就业材料收集、按班级分类归档，到7月3日当天对每一份档案内的学籍记录、每一张证书的编号进行逐项核验，班主任与辅导员分工协作、一丝不苟。他们对照毕业生预留的邮寄地址反复确认，确保上千份材料“零差错”入袋封装。不少老师表示，这是能为学生们做的最后一次“琐碎”而重要的工作，必须用心用情，不留遗憾。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=volr67LlUioR7DL_m9PMRA7M8l8Um-F8LznRolL8M474nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaokysnSyiLNlioRUbL8M2nNCPMzQfoz-sLR-DMR7PnzfFnmGsM4GZMRAFnz-iMSb