_file.vsb?afc=vMm76YM7M7UzWko_RVkMz9DMl-aUzGF8M4UDM4LDMzTRUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyin1y8MSh7MlWkozrVL8W2LN-DLmLso7LYozn2U8L4UNWFUNQRU4UbnR6FMR-YMlUJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/55F45D5BB95E3BF2B62378C294FCC3BB/BFCC49D7/4225D\" vheight=\"225.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"183.0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vMm76YM7M7UzWko_RVkMz9DMl-aUzGF8M4UDM4LDMzTRUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyin1y8MSh7MlWkozrVL8W2LN-DLmLso7LYozn2U8L4UNWFUNQRU4UbnR6FMR-YMlUJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vL4l6snzNPU8lDU_4A2M4UDMlCZU8rFRnzUiMzlPMR6fnz90gihFp2hmCIa0LSybnSy4M1yYMzNZUzl4UlLsnm94LzCsoRT2MRfVL7MkU8QFMmfRLmfkMmVFMNQVU4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/19E362598A53AC7F8316789F40E0CBCF/60C20B61/6FEC5\" vheight=\"332.5299987792969\" vwidth=\"198.1999969482422\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vL4l6snzNPU8lDU_4A2M4UDMlCZU8rFRnzUiMzlPMR6fnz90gihFp2hmCIa0LSybnSy4M1yYMzNZUzl4UlLsnm94LzCsoRT2MRfVL7MkU8QFMmfRLmfkMmVFMNQVU4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vMzn6VM8QfozARo_RGsnNCDUzN4Um7FsLN-PnN7bM7VkU4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkM1h7MSybMmCDM4UsnRV2UmC4nmLiolU4oRrRMlVRL4MFL8-sUNM2L4fFMmU8M7UJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3B6D59666747D1FB63F359D385C5AC33/3B7BCF30/6444D\" vheight=\"333.3299865722656\" vwidth=\"199.39999389648438\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vMzn6VM8QfozARo_RGsnNCDUzN4Um7FsLN-PnN7bM7VkU4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkM1h7MSybMmCDM4UsnRV2UmC4nmLiolU4oRrRMlVRL4MFL8-sUNM2L4fFMmU8M7UJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.png\"></p><p>将温情打包进包裹，用责任守护好前程。随着最后一批包裹贴上快递单，机械工程学院顺利完成2026届毕业生档案与证件集中邮寄工作。学院相关负责人表示，毕业班班主任和辅导员在毕业季始终坚守岗位，以细致的服务打通离校“最后一公里”，用实际行动诠释“站好最后一班岗”的庄严承诺。这份跨越山海的邮件，不仅寄去了开启未来的“钥匙”，更寄去了学院对全体毕业生长路漫漫、前程似锦的深情祝福。</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLNl6aUlLYnzlDn_mWkUN7Yo7CYn77F8UzVRLlMkozMfMN70gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hVM1y8M4laMm7Ynm6fMlnRMm-PUNMRnm9YozV2L4AFn7VkMRV2UNWFUNVVM1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LbMRUsgtA8pU9cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39447&e=.jpeg"}